## https://yazi-rs.github.io/docs/quick-start/#keybindings
yazi: (Navigation) Move the cursor up/down                                       | k/j / Up/Dn
yazi: (Navigation) Enter hovered directory                                       | l/Rt
yazi: (Navigation) Leave the current directory                                   | h/Lt
yazi: (Navigation) Seek up/down 5 units in the preview                           | K/J
yazi: (Navigation) Move cursor to the top/bottom                                 | gg/G
yazi: (Selection) Toggle selection of hovered file/directory                     | Spc
yazi: (Selection) Enter visual mode (selection/unset mode)                       | v/V
yazi: (Selection) Select all files                                               | C-a
yazi: (Selection) Inverse selection of all files                                 | C-r
yazi: (Selection) Cancel selection                                               | Esc
yazi: (File operations) Open selected files                                      | o/Etr
yazi: (File operations) Open selected files interactively                        | O/S-Etr
yazi: (File operations) Show the file information                                | Tab
yazi: (File operations) Yank selected files (cut/copy)                           | xy
yazi: (File operations) Paste yanked files                                       | p
yazi: (File operations) Paste yanked files (overwrite if the destination exists) | P
yazi: (File operations) Cancel the yank status                                   | Y/X
yazi: (File operations) Trash selected files                                     | d
yazi: (File operations) Permanently delete selected files                        | D
yazi: (File operations) Create a file (ends with / for directories)              | a
yazi: (File operations) Rename selected file(s)                                  | r
yazi: (File operations) Toggle the visibility of hidden files                    | .
yazi: (File operations) Run a shell command                                      | ;
yazi: (File operations) Run a shell command (block until finishes)               | :
yazi: (File operations) Symlink the absolute/relative path of yanked files       | -/_
yazi: (File operations) Hardlink yanked files                                    | C--
yazi: (Copy paths) Copy the file path                                            | cc
yazi: (Copy paths) Copy the directory path                                       | cd
yazi: (Copy paths) Copy the filename                                             | cf
yazi: (Copy paths) Copy the filename without extension                           | cn
yazi: (Filter files) Filter files                                                | f
yazi: (Find files) Find next/previous file                                       | //?
yazi: (Find files) Go to the next/previous found                                 | n/N
yazi: (Search files) Search files by name using fd                               | s
yazi: (Search files) Search files by content using ripgrep                       | S
yazi: (Search files) Cancel the ongoing search                                   | C-s
yazi: (Sorting) Sort by modified time/(reverse)                                  | ,m/,M
yazi: (Sorting) Sort by birth time/(reverse)                                     | ,b/,B
yazi: (Sorting) Sort by file extension/(reverse)                                 | ,e/,E
yazi: (Sorting) Sort alphabetically/(reverse)                                    | ,a/,A
yazi: (Sorting) Sort naturally/(reverse)                                         | ,n/,N
yazi: (Sorting) Sort by size/(reverse)                                           | ,s/,S
yazi: (Sorting) Sort randomly                                                    | ,r
yazi: (Multi-tab) Create a new tab with CWD                                      | t
yazi: (Multi-tab) Switch to the $-th tab                                         | $
yazi: (Multi-tab) Switch to the previous/next tab                                | [/]
yazi: (Multi-tab) Swap current tab with previous/next tab                        | {/}
yazi: (Multi-tab) Close the current tab                                          | C-c
yazi: Open wezterm at current dir (User)                                         | T
yazi:: close-and-restore-tab: (Tabs) Close the current tab, or quit if it's last | C-w
yazi:: close-and-restore-tab: Restore the previously closed tab                  | C-t
yazi:: bifold: Toggle split tabs mode                                            | \\
yazi:: bifold: Switch to the other pane                                          | Tab
yazi:: bifold: Copy to the other pane                                            | F5
yazi:: bifold: Move to the other pane                                            | F6
yazi:: bifold: Toggle preview pane                                               | b
yazi:: bifold: Flip side-by-side/top-bottom                                      | S-f
yazi:: bifold: Shrink/grow active pane                                           | C-Lt/Rt
yazi:: split-tabs: Toggle split-tabs mode                                        | \
yazi:: split-tabs: Switch to the other split pane                                | Tab
yazi:: split-tabs: Toggle preview pane                                           | P
yazi:: toggle-pane: Maximize or restore the preview pane                         | Z
yazi:: clipboard: Yank selected files and copy to system clipboard               | y
yazi:: clipboard: Paste from system clipboard                                    | C-p
yazi:: relative-path: Copy relative path from the started path                   | cr
yazi:: copy-file-contents: Copy contents of hovered file                         | A-y
yazi:: fast-enter: Fast-enter subfolder, or open file directly                   | l
yazi:: sticky-filter: Sticky filter                                              | f
yazi:: fd-fzf: Jump to directory (fd+fzf)                                        | sz
yazi:: fd-fzf: Jump to directory, hidden included                                | sZ
yazi:: fd-fzf: Jump to directory (with preview)                                  | sp
yazi:: initial-cwd: Go to initial directory                                      | g Spc
yazi:: clipboard-jump: Jump to path in system clipboard                          | gp
yazi:: zoxide-add: Jump                                                          | z
yazi:: bookmarks: Save current position as a bookmark                            | m
yazi:: bookmarks: Jump to a bookmark                                             | bb
yazi:: bookmarks: Delete a bookmark                                              | bd
yazi:: bookmarks: Delete all bookmarks                                           | bD
yazi:: compress: Archive selected files                                          | caa
yazi:: compress: Archive selected files (password)                               | cap
yazi:: compress: Archive selected files (password+header)                        | cah
yazi:: compress: Archive selected files (compression level)                      | cal
yazi:: compress: Archive selected files (password+header+level)                  | cau
yazi:: custom-shell: Run custom-shell interactively                              | ';
yazi:: custom-shell: Run custom-shell interactively (block)                      | ':
yazi:: lazygit: Run lazygit                                                      | Gi
yazi:: makelink: Save source path(s)                                             | cls
yazi:: makelink: Create soft link(s)                                             | cll
yazi:: makelink: Create hard link(s)                                             | clh
yazi:: makelink: Clear saved paths                                               | clc
yazi:: open-with-cmd: Open with command in the terminal                          | o
yazi:: open-with-cmd: Open with command                                          | O
yazi:: eza-preview: Toggle tree/list dir preview                                 | et
yazi:: eza-preview: Increment tree level                                         | e-
yazi:: eza-preview: Decrement tree level                                         | e_
yazi:: eza-preview: Toggle tree follow symlinks                                  | e$
yazi:: eza-preview: Toggle hidden files                                          | e*
yazi:: eza-preview: Toggle .gitignore files                                      | egi
yazi:: eza-preview: Toggle showing git status                                    | egs
yazi:: mediainfo: Toggle media preview metadata                                  | F3
yazi:: f3d: Orbit forward (seek 5/-5)                                            | j/k
yazi:: f3d: Orbit the 3D preview forward/backward                                | A-l/A-h
yazi:: f3d: Zoom in/out hovered file                                             | +/-
yazi:: chmod: Chmod on selected files                                            | cm
yazi:: mount: Mount manager                                                      | M
yazi:: sxiv: Preview images in sxiv                                              | Ps